  "details": "I think it could be helpful if when you go too far from a player, it automatically lowers their poly count and shaders to something that is easier to render. If that would cause more issues then it'd fix, it would at least be nice to load a fallback avatar when you get too far from a model\nI'd assume this could help quest a lot, where there was a slider or something so you could choose how far away to be to unload a model and change it with a fallback avatar. Maybe not the top priority but it sounds helpful",
